=\"async\">","src":"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/stock-server-room-1024.webp"}},{"k":"s3","type":"s","label":"List item 1","default":"01"},{"k":"s4","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 1","default":"The problem"},{"k":"s5","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 2","default":"Exchange Online, SharePoint, Teams and OneDrive were central to operations, but the business relied entirely on Microsoft’s native retention. After accidental deletions, management recognised the need for dedicated backup to support long-term continuity."},{"k":"s6","type":"s","label":"List item 2","default":"02"},{"k":"s7","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 3","default":"Our action"},{"k":"s8","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 4","default":"We reviewed the Microsoft 365 environment, identified where critical information lived, and implemented dedicated backup across Exchange Online, SharePoint, OneDrive and Teams, with backup monitoring, recovery validation and multi-factor authentication."},{"k":"s9","type":"s","label":"Figure 1","default":"24%"},{"k":"s10","type":"s","label":"Figure label 1","default":"Less admin time on IT issues"},{"k":"s11","type":"s","label":"Figure 2","default":"21%"},{"k":"s12","type":"s","label":"Figure label 2","default":"Better staff efficiency"},{"k":"s13","type":"s","label":"Figure 3","default":"4×"},{"k":"s14","type":"s","label":"Figure label 3","default":"Visibility across locations"},{"k":"s15","type":"s","label":"Figure 4","default":"5 mo"},{"k":"s16","type":"s","label":"Figure label 4","default":"To measurable results"}]}